    {
        "text": "Hm...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard you singing. There is no need to hide. I bear you no ill will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The headsmen all say that. But in the end, they draw blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headsman? I am afraid I do not understand your wording. I represent the Laterano Notarial Hall\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up! You can't fool me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
