        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your awareness of your surroundings is impressive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll turn you into a pincushion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "H- he caught it with his hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... what the hell are you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the report states, the heir is fickle, slow to trust, and difficult to communicate with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4"
    },
    {
        "text": "The above is my last will and testament in its entirety."
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I have one final, selfish request."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the forests of Siracusa, I met a one-armed Vulpo girl."
    },
    {
        "text": "She had long walked a single-minded path of revenge."
    },
    {
        "text": "In my compassion, I gave her aid. While this may have hurt her pride, I found myself moved by her stubborn determination to survive."
    },
    {
        "text": "I later learned that the aid I gave her only strengthened her obsession with revenge, which left me uneasy."
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to give her all that I have. Sadly, that is very little. Only a few sad heirlooms."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Pardon the interruption, but there is no Vulpo on your list of kin. This will make our work rather difficult."
    },
    {
        "text": "As such, this is but a petty request from a childless Laterano citizen on his deathbed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_forest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I smell blood on him. And he gives me a nasty feeling...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Another fella coming to wreck up our homestead? Gross!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "He took the bait!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. Another trap. There are trigger mechanisms all over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up! You walked right into a hunter's trap. If you don't wanna die, hand over your weapons and don't move!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If that will aid communication, I will comply.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am an executor from the Laterano Notarial Hall, working as executor of this estate. You may call me 'Executor.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Laterano...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "'Vermeil,' you are the target of my mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you know my name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your name was given by the deceased, Mr D\u00fcrrenmatt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know any D\u00fcrrenmatt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "For several reasons, he used a variety of aliases.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where do you wanna take me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In the interests of secrecy, I cannot say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Grr, you're full of it! You're gonna die here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not leaving. My mom, my dad, my uncle, my auntie, my friends, my people, they're all, all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My task is to bring only you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up! Do you even know where you are?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am in a situation in which I am unable to advance my mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmph. Anything that walks into this forest is our prey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bones you're standing on are all beasts and even worse people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. The area around this base of operations was full of traps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pits, snares, landmines, triggered darts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rest assured, I have disarmed them all. The traps were of basic construction, but carried the possibility of injuring the object.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014! Stay back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "One step closer and I'll shoot you dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$leaveshake",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_279_excu_4"
    },
    {
        "text": "She escaped again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, why did you save me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a hunter too, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I look past a respected colleague, short one arm and lying in a pile of her own guts next to a big old tusker?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... You're no hunter. You can't fool me. I don't smell any dirt on you at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. I guess I can't. But when I saw you there, I was moved by how well a little one like you had conquered the wilderness. That's the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just saying what comes to mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the deal with the circle on your head? And the thingies on your back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you never seen a Laterano before, Little One?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are... I guess they're what's left of my homeland I walked away from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't ever clean off the dirt from your hometown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you're right. The short of it is, a lot's happened. Come, let's try to get you walking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me put this on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... it's an arm? A metal arm? What a weird thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A token of my respect for a child of the wilderness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "You a carpenter? A metalworker?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I learned all sorts of things in my old job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You saved me, so you can't be bad. I'm gonna need an arm to get my revenge. So thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Revenge, huh...? Well, I can't decide your fate for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when you pull your bowstring with this arm, I hope you'll think about why it is we're alive, besides revenge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't think enough, you might just end up like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to hear you say 'I live for revenge.' That's too cliche.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Damn right. Totally played out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Huntsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_forest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Laterano... He said he's from Laterano...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It couldn't be...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ack! That hurts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems Mr D\u00fcrrenmatt's assessment was correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it, how long have you been hunting me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Let me go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop resisting. I cannot hurt you, as you are the heir to this will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a letter from the deceased.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.02,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you continue to resist?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's his scent. The letter has the scent of his blood. What did you do to him?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The journey from Laterano to this place was extremely long. It is not possible that any scent of the deceased remains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Answer me! Or I'll kill you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "First, I believe demonstrating the power differential at hand may aid in communication.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Second, out of respect for you as the heir, I will answer your question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr D\u00fcrrenmatt died on the operating table. It was not a peaceful passing. He suffered from an incurable disease.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014\u2014! Let go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Such was his choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Wh- what are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium crystals have already pierced the skin. The infection continues to worsen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "None of your business!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If the object insists on rejecting her benefit, according to regulations, I am permitted to abandon the task.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the client and my superiors issued a subordinating clause. I must execute it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014What the hell are you trying to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "'Let Vermeil live.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "As this is a rather broad request, executing it will be quite complicated. It is my hope that you cooperate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's what he asked you to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct. He sold all of his property, paid a number of additional fees, including those of the Notarial Hall, as well as the costs of your future medical treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, why? I'm just some girl from the forest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He wants you to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm asking why!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because he believed you deserve to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that the last will and testament has been executed, my work here is done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh...! When did you slip this to me\u2014\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we proceed to the next phase, I must hear your reply.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Do you want to live?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You need only answer: 'Yes,' or 'no.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our time is limited.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Mister, what am I supposed to call you?"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Executor. If you must call me something."
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for accepting my request."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014It was the Notarial Hall's decision. I am merely executing my duties."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, sure enough. And while you're looking for Vermeil, I have another little request."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Depending on the nature of the request, I may reject your verbal appeal. I would prefer you submit it in written form to the Notarial Hall."
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a real hardass, huh? Doesn't matter. It's just a little thing."
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell her anything about my past, if you can. Make up some story. Tell her I died on the operating table."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014I do not understand the need for this request. Nor does it fit with the truth. You fled the Notarial Hall's justice for many years, and you shot dead..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough. What if I told you doing it this way would save you a lot of trouble in getting your job done?"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014If in my judgment I agree with your assessment, I will consider your request."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_towerinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...So this Rhodes Island place, they can really cure this crazy disease?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Medical science has yet to cure Oripathy. But they may be able to alleviate your suffering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering what you did to the Ursus, I advise against continuing to act alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it just happens that I must go to Rhodes Island on another matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you asking me to go with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe that would be most logical.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. I refuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still have a lot to do before I can leave here. I have to say goodbye to my people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It is dangerous here. Hatred does not end in compromise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... You sure know a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care what you know. Don't get in my way. I can still go to this Rhodes Island place even after I settle everything, can't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Allow me to calculate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I must calculate if I have enough ammunition to deal with those fugitives when they find you again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ammunition...? You mean you would go out into the barrens with me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In accordance with your answer, you have been marked by the Notarial Hall as having accepted your inheritance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, the contents of the will have not been fully executed. I cannot allow you to expose yourself to such danger. This is my duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need your help! I'm used to being on my own\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, I believe you seek to compromise with me, and then seize the opportunity to escape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no time to waste. Let us depart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! I didn't say yes! I don't need some outlander to come and... Hey, wait! Where are you going? Do you even know the way?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your feet, there's\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I have disarmed the traps. Come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Executor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_190_clour",
        "name2": "char_279_excu_4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaah\u2014\u2014Sooner or later, I'll show you, you weirdo\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vermeil"
